<Container left="684" top="422" width="285.12" height="32" backgroundColor="#2A7A5E" borderRadius="16" />
<Text x="684" y="440" fontSize="18" color="#FFFFFF" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" fontWeight="bold" textAlign="CENTER" boxWidth="285.12">选 B 少缴 2,520 元</Text>
<Text x="948" y="428" fontSize="13" color="#A8A294" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC">演示口径，人人不同</Text>
<Container left="660" top="560.8" width="12" height="12" backgroundColor="#C9A227" borderRadius="6" />
<Text x="682" y="556" fontSize="15" color="#2E2A22" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC">每年度单独计税只可用一次</Text>
<Container left="660" top="602.8" width="12" height="12" backgroundColor="#C9A227" borderRadius="6" />
<Text x="682" y="598" fontSize="15" color="#2E2A22" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC">发薪时是预扣；次年汇算可改选</Text>
<Container left="660" top="644.8" width="12" height="12" backgroundColor="#C9A227" borderRadius="6" />
<Text x="682" y="640" fontSize="15" color="#2E2A22" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC">归属看实际发放年份</Text>
<Text x="660" y="672" fontSize="15" color="#2E2A22" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC">怎么用：发放月先梳全年收入与扣除；</Text>
<Text x="660" y="696" fontSize="15" color="#2E2A22" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC">个税 App 两法各试算一遍，选税额低者。</Text>
<Container left="64" top="700" width="560" height="76" backgroundColor="#F1ECD8" borderRadius="12" />
<Text x="84" y="712" fontSize="13" color="#2E2A22" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC">月均线 3,000 是「月均」：36,001 ÷ 12 = 3,000.08，</Text>
<Text x="84" y="736" fontSize="13" color="#2E2A22" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC">整单税率即跳 10%；至 38,566.67 元起补回，到手追平 34,920。</Text>
<Text x="0" y="800" fontSize="14" color="#7C766A" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" textAlign="CENTER" boxWidth="1180">单独计税公式：税 = 奖金 ×（奖金 ÷ 12 定档税率）− 速算扣除数；示例虚构，不构成税务建议 · 演示数据</Text>
</Stack>
</Snapshot>
